   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HUMAN RIGHTS DEVELOPMENT INITIATIVE - HRDI 2      2010-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On account of poverty, many rural households are unable to pay for    legal services  when they fall victims of human rights abuse. The     project targets vulnerable members of society through awareness       creation on their rights. This is achieved through legal clinincs     conducted by Schools of Law in Universities. The porject also takes   up selected  matters of HIV discrimination to courts of law.</narrative>
